{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dicey Hacker 1999 is a cyberpunk roguelike built around dice-based deckbuilding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, dice are not random numbers \u2014 they are your actions, skills, and the system itself.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Key Features\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Dice Are Equipment. Dice Are Justice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every die has its own unique properties, forming the core of your offensive toolkit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining dice with different attributes, each run offers a fresh and distinct combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/549d559d2fe83bdd093a4c4da5424ed0.poster.avif?t=1774337458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/549d559d2fe83bdd093a4c4da5424ed0.webm?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/549d559d2fe83bdd093a4c4da5424ed0.mp4?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Hacker Software Modules (Relics)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various software modules scattered throughout cyberspace during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create powerful synergies unique to your build \u2014 enabling stronger energy loops, higher damage output, and more chaining opportunities. Countless playstyles await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.poster.avif?t=1774337458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.webm?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.mp4?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Class Specializations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class features its own distinct combat traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the activation conditions of class abilities are met, unleash powerful effects to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.poster.avif?t=1774337458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.webm?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.mp4?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3726190?t=1774337458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/83c2bc15e7d13b7be514c8495d6fe32456baaa9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774337458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/d29223d9b111206440883c16c88e4bcd993215de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774337458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/d29223d9b11120644