ger energy loops, higher damage output, and more chaining opportunities. Countless playstyles await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.poster.avif?t=1774337458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.webm?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/428d2d3fd003776218896fbc344a8906.mp4?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Class Specializations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class features its own distinct combat traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the activation conditions of class abilities are met, unleash powerful effects to gain the upper hand in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.poster.avif?t=1774337458\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.webm?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726190/extras/ce9f12080bd1192e6b24a7ca74671152.mp4?t=1774337458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HuanMos Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_